WEBVTT

00:00:00.810 --> 00:00:06.050
Toys. They are miraculous buds that swell from the hearts of the chosen.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:12.510
Some flowers are born pure, while others bloom laced with poison.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.350
The Age of Detectives.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:18.620
The two flowers, vying for beauty.

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:24.290
Their names are the Detective and the Phantom Thief.

00:02:23.530 --> 00:02:26.650
No, thats...

00:02:31.770 --> 00:02:33.360
Time to clean!

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:38.570
If I don't clean...

00:02:41.650 --> 00:02:46.480
My little tangerine... my little tangerine...

00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:04.350
Alert! The art museum's prized jewel, Yokohama's Tear, has been stolen by a phantom thief―

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:10.900
Yokohama's Tear...

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:13.610
Such a beautiful thing...

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:17.490
It certainly has a splendid radiance that befits you, Arsène-sama.

00:03:17.490 --> 00:03:21.800
But of course, your beauty is still worlds above it, Arsène-sama.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:24.940
That's as far as you go!

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:26.180
Turn yourselves in!

00:03:27.530 --> 00:03:29.630
So you've finally appeared...

00:03:29.630 --> 00:03:31.130
Milky Holmes!

00:03:31.130 --> 00:03:35.590
Phantom Thieves Arsène, Stone River, Twenty, and...

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:36.540
Rabbit!

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:37.900
It's Rat.

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.650
We will never let you get away!

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:42.110
We won't let you get away...

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:45.070
We'll be taking the Yokohama's Tear back.

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:49.830
Can you really catch me?

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:53.750
Don't take us lightly! We have been trained by Kobayashi-sensei!

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:57.630
I have never looked down on you.

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:01.570
S-She's gone?

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:05.430
Stone River, en garde!

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:12.780
That's some strong Toys you've got there, superhuman girl!

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:15.900
No... please stop!

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:17.690
Don't say it like that...

00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:24.160
Eat this! Toys of Flame!

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:39.030
That was clo-

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:44.880
Sher! Behind you!

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:49.890
Please stop your futile resistance!

00:04:56.240 --> 00:04:57.860
Such a messy birdcage.

00:04:58.420 --> 00:05:02.530
I wanted you to make a more beautiful one for me, you know.

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:04.970
Phantom Thief Arsène! I shall arrest you!

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:07.230
Arsène-sama!

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:14.470
I shall be taking my leave here, Milky Holmes.

00:05:14.470 --> 00:05:18.050
Yokohama's Tear is now mine.

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:19.700
Idiots!

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:21.170
Oh no you don't!

00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:26.990
So you really want to capture me that much, eh...

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:30.490
Of course! A detective's duty is to catch phantom thieves!

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:33.420
What an honor. However...

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:36.500
Toys of Resplendence.

00:05:51.070 --> 00:05:52.580
As expected of our Arsène-sama!

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:55.300
It looked just like a real explosion!

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:57.540
So this is Resplendence...

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:58.460
I...

00:06:00.490 --> 00:06:03.700
...haven't done anything yet...

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:15.780
Is everyone okay?

00:06:18.430 --> 00:06:21.160
Ah, I'm fine.

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:25.020
I am also fine.

00:06:25.020 --> 00:06:28.310
You won't get away, Arsène...

00:06:28.310 --> 00:06:30.690
You can't have gotten that far yet...

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:32.850
Huh?

00:06:35.740 --> 00:06:37.710
Did you find something out?

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:40.860
I can't see anything!

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:41.920
I can't hear...

00:06:43.310 --> 00:06:45.210
M-Me too...

00:06:49.160 --> 00:06:51.580
I can't... summon my strength...

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:55.580
Move!

00:06:56.320 --> 00:06:57.300
Move!!

00:06:57.300 --> 00:06:59.300
Move, damn it!

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:02.050
Why won't you move?

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:05.010
I can control machines...

00:07:05.010 --> 00:07:07.360
They're supposed to do what I tell them, right?

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:09.110
So why?!

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:11.820
Nero, too... what has happened?

00:07:12.220 --> 00:07:13.350
My Toys...

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:15.530
It's gone!

00:07:22.910 --> 00:07:25.290
<i>Move! Move!</i>

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:28.290
<i>Move...</i>

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:31.420
<i>...you stone!</i>

00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:37.560
It won't move... why won't it move?

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:41.100
My Toys... it's gone!

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:42.250
No way...

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:43.790
What is this?

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:46.080
What happened?!

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:48.530
No!!

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:11.920
Stop...

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:14.620
I guess... not...

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:20.140
I'm late!

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:25.990
The alarm clock was broken! It didn't ring!

00:08:25.990 --> 00:08:26.930
Really?

00:08:26.930 --> 00:08:28.070
Yes, really!

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:29.660
You're one to talk, Nero!

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:32.070
You looked real happy drooling in your sleep, Cordelia!

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:36.320
There's no way that I'd be drooling! How rude!

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:38.910
Ooh sweet, bulls-eye!

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:39.810
Nero!

00:08:39.810 --> 00:08:44.110
Now now, you two. I actually like drool.

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:46.300
That's so stupid!

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:50.180
Ah, I'm starved! I went without breakfast!

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:53.180
I want food! I want food!

00:08:53.180 --> 00:08:57.580
We've been late so much lately. It dishonors Holmes Detective Academy!

00:08:57.580 --> 00:09:00.610
It's fine if we're just late. Right, Herc?

00:09:00.610 --> 00:09:01.910
Ah, um...

00:09:01.910 --> 00:09:05.060
Oh, look at that! That cloud looks like fish paste!

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:07.050
How...?

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:14.140
Save me!

00:09:14.140 --> 00:09:15.610
Oh no!

00:09:18.470 --> 00:09:22.100
Jeez! Herc, why didn't you hold on?

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:22.750
Um...

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:25.180
You dragged me in on purpose, didn't you?

00:09:25.180 --> 00:09:28.080
Now now, let's get to school and change our uniforms!

00:09:28.390 --> 00:09:30.690
You were mostly to blame!

00:09:30.690 --> 00:09:32.410
Even if you tell me that...

00:09:32.410 --> 00:09:34.510
G-Good morning.

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:35.920
Good morning.

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:38.620
Good morning, Ishinagare-san.

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:43.960
<i>Sheesh... ever since Milky Holmes lost their Toys, they've become so useless...</i>

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:49.380
<i>Nonetheless, why did Arsène-sama tell us to infiltrate this academy?</i>

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:54.470
Toys are wonderful and mysterious powers attained at birth.

00:09:54.470 --> 00:10:01.340
I, Nijuuri Kai, was born with this excellent and beautiful face!

00:10:01.340 --> 00:10:02.530
However!!

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:06.110
There are actually many different kinds of Toys!

00:10:06.110 --> 00:10:10.070
Toys of Flame, Toys of Ice, Toys of Sense, and also ones for Teleportation, Strength, and Telekinesis!

00:10:10.070 --> 00:10:11.240
Yay!

00:10:11.240 --> 00:10:14.660
Incidentally, my beautiful face and looks―

00:10:14.660 --> 00:10:15.520
Wow!

00:10:15.520 --> 00:10:17.070
―are <i>not</i> related to Toys!!

00:10:17.070 --> 00:10:19.540
Not in the slightest, you hear me?!

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:23.970
Only those who possess Toys can become detectives!

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:29.470
You must improve your own Toys in this academy,
search for chaotic and destructive Phantom Thieves,

00:10:29.470 --> 00:10:32.570
and fight against them!!

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:35.220
Phantom Thieves have become...

00:10:35.220 --> 00:10:38.140
...beautiful, like me!

00:10:38.140 --> 00:10:43.160
No, it is certain, for I <i>am</i> a Phantom Thief.

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:43.980
Right...

00:10:43.980 --> 00:10:45.900
Sensei, I don't understand.

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:56.690
It's Milky Holmes! They're late again?

00:10:56.690 --> 00:10:58.230
Why are they dripping wet?

00:10:58.230 --> 00:11:01.910
Now that they've lost their Toys, the Milky Holmes are nothing but typical loli dykes, eh?

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:05.100
W-We're sorry for being late, Nijuuri-sensei!

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:09.940
Why are you dripping wet?

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:12.100
Well, at the pond...

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:17.150
You'll catch a cold. Wear that.

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:18.240
First come, first serve!

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:20.920
We'll go get changed.

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:41.420
Yes, you're just like that shirt, Miserable Milky Holmes.

00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:44.010
Sensei, your nipples are erect.

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:05.930
Ishinagare-san...

00:12:05.930 --> 00:12:08.620
They came late again today, right?

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:10.400
Yes, Arsène-sa-

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:14.150
I mean, student council president, Henriette-sama.

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:18.090
Moreover, they haven't just fallen in the pond, but in classes after that, too.

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:23.840
In tailing class...

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:30.720
They are easily noticed.

00:12:31.590 --> 00:12:33.480
Don't notice me...

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:38.480
In human observation class...

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:40.510
N-No!

00:12:40.510 --> 00:12:43.150
They get embarrassed and run away.

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:48.810
In profiling class...

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:05.600
Now that they've lost their Toys, the Milky Holmes really have become good-for-nothings!

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:07.790
No matter what they do, it's an epic fail!

00:13:07.790 --> 00:13:10.930
They're leftovers from the elite and are now just a gaggle of plain obnoxious kids!

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:13.710
Nezu-san.

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:17.150
What did you just say?

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:21.650
U-Um... good-for-nothing leftovers...

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:26.090
Don't stutter!

00:13:26.090 --> 00:13:28.410
It's fine!

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:34.210
It's as you say.

00:13:36.470 --> 00:13:41.880
They were the team that used to be the cream of the crop in Holmes Detective Academy, too.

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:50.070
Milky Holmes was the team that was trained by the legendary great detective, Kobayashi Opera.

00:13:50.770 --> 00:13:53.220
They really lived up to their role,

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:56.850
cornering the Phantom Thief Arsène many times.

00:13:57.790 --> 00:14:01.130
Every student in the academy admired them.

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:04.290
They were all "Ahh, I want to be just like a Milky Holmes detective."

00:14:05.390 --> 00:14:10.370
However, after Kobayashi Opera passed away,
they failed to capture the Phantom Thief Arsène,

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:13.750
and now that they've lost their Toys as well...

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:16.780
What's for dinner tonight?

00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:19.030
I'm tired of steak.

00:14:19.030 --> 00:14:22.480
If you're tired of steak, why don't you just eat sushi?

00:14:24.150 --> 00:14:30.700
Since they were skilled detectives, they are pampered in the academy and dorms.

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:32.250
However...

00:14:32.250 --> 00:14:34.390
They have already lost their brilliance.

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:40.430
Look at that, it's for Milky Holmes!

00:14:40.430 --> 00:14:41.560
Lucky!

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:44.080
Our food just isn't enough...

00:14:44.080 --> 00:14:46.030
Awesome, whole roasted pig!

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:47.570
I'll have a pork loin!

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:48.730
I'll have a fillet!

00:14:48.730 --> 00:14:50.600
I'll have...

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:53.300
My pig!

00:14:56.520 --> 00:14:58.730
Student Council President Henriette!

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:02.150
Sherlock Shellingford-san.

00:15:02.150 --> 00:15:03.950
Y-Yes?

00:15:03.950 --> 00:15:05.540
Cordelia Glauca-san.

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:06.470
Yes.

00:15:06.470 --> 00:15:07.940
Hercule Barton-san.

00:15:07.940 --> 00:15:08.790
Yes?

00:15:08.790 --> 00:15:10.230
Yuzurizaki Nero-san.

00:15:10.230 --> 00:15:11.350
Yes.

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:17.500
Before you feast, I have something that I would like you all to do.

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:19.890
Something t-t-t-to do?

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:23.770
A test tailored for the detectives of Milky Holmes.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:29.360
So it's started...

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:35.450
B-Bomb?

00:15:36.110 --> 00:15:43.460
That picture was from the time Milky Holmes got a certificate of achievement for solving its first case!

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:49.460
Our precious memory...

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:51.220
Why is it...

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:53.630
This is an aptitude test.

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:56.180
I would like you to stop this bomb within the time limit.

00:15:57.170 --> 00:16:01.770
It's simple. Out of the three bombs here, there is only one real one.

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:04.550
If you press the real one's button, the explosion shall be prevented.

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:11.350
Or, you can destroy the reinforced glass.

00:16:12.910 --> 00:16:15.820
Another way would be to unlock the electronic lock.

00:16:17.480 --> 00:16:19.790
You can also trip the breaker from a distance.

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:22.420
There are several ways to do it.

00:16:22.420 --> 00:16:24.220
Please do as you wish.

00:16:24.220 --> 00:16:26.400
Your time limit is thirty seconds.

00:16:26.660 --> 00:16:27.520
Well then...

00:16:27.520 --> 00:16:28.740
Please wait a minute!

00:16:28.740 --> 00:16:31.630
W-Why must we do something like this?

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:33.160
I don't get it!

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:37.260
It's to keep your extravagant private rooms, exquisite cuisine, and other prestigious privileges.

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:41.180
They were all given to you when Milky Holmes was deemed an excellent team.

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:44.440
However, as you are now, you have become too useless.

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:50.190
It is wrong to keep such useless company in special favor.

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:55.860
This determines whether you're useless, not useless,

00:16:55.860 --> 00:17:01.110
whether that uselesslessness is only a temporary uselesslessness, or that uselesslesslessness is permanent.

00:17:01.110 --> 00:17:03.220
Please don't say uselesslessness!

00:17:03.220 --> 00:17:04.390
No tongue twisters!

00:17:06.480 --> 00:17:08.900
That test is impossible for you!

00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:10.660
You'll never be able to do it anyways!

00:17:10.660 --> 00:17:11.460
That's right, that's right!

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:13.070
We all know how this is gonna end up.

00:17:13.070 --> 00:17:14.810
They haven't had any powers for a long time.

00:17:14.810 --> 00:17:16.830
They're separated from their Toys anyways!

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:19.790
Their careers as Detectives are over, eh?

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:20.640
We can do it!

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:25.350
Our Toys will definitely come back to us!

00:17:30.930 --> 00:17:34.100
<i>Breaker-san... please!</i>

00:17:37.190 --> 00:17:38.230
Move!

00:17:38.230 --> 00:17:39.560
Leave it to me!

00:17:42.780 --> 00:17:45.710
<i>Feel it, Cordelia Glauca...</i>

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:48.160
<i>Which is the real switch?</i>

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:52.410
By the way, if you press the wrong switch, it will explode.

00:17:54.540 --> 00:17:57.280
<i>Hear it, Cordelia Glauca...</i>

00:17:57.280 --> 00:17:59.580
<i>Everything has a sound...</i>

00:17:59.580 --> 00:18:03.140
<i>Its name... its face...</i>

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:07.810
Move. I'll do it.

00:18:09.850 --> 00:18:10.990
Slow!

00:18:10.990 --> 00:18:13.100
What kind of Toys of Sense was that?!

00:18:13.100 --> 00:18:15.930
I didn't see <i>you</i> do anything to solve it either, Sher!

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:22.120
What'll you do if it breaks?!

00:18:27.060 --> 00:18:29.870
Break... break...

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:35.690
Please work!

00:18:35.690 --> 00:18:37.700
You can do it!

00:18:57.190 --> 00:18:58.970
Well then, you are hereby expelled.

00:18:58.970 --> 00:19:00.030
Expelled?!

00:19:02.980 --> 00:19:05.400
...which is what I would like to say, but...

00:19:06.170 --> 00:19:08.710
I shall give you an extension of three months.

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:13.700
If you are unable to retrieve your Toys and revive yourselves as detectives within three months...

00:19:13.700 --> 00:19:15.790
Did lightning just strike down?

00:19:16.950 --> 00:19:19.340
...then you shall be expelled.

00:19:20.270 --> 00:19:22.430
You'll wait three months for us?

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:23.900
Thank you very much!

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:27.530
Until that time, we will surely make a comeback with our Toys!

00:19:27.530 --> 00:19:30.130
Yay, I love this student council president!

00:19:30.130 --> 00:19:33.410
Ahh, thank god!

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:44.770
This shall be your room from now on.

00:19:45.750 --> 00:19:47.760
In such a dusty room?!

00:19:47.760 --> 00:19:49.470
Where's our canopy beds?

00:19:49.470 --> 00:19:50.790
We've sealed your private rooms.

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:52.790
No way!

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:56.450
Understood? You shall only have three months.

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:04.370
If only Cordelia had stopped that explosion...

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:07.670
<i>You're</i> worse off for breaking the electronic lock, Nero!

00:20:07.670 --> 00:20:10.730
Ehh? So you're saying that <i>I'm</i> the useless one here?

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:11.890
I could be!

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:14.880
Everyone, don't fight! Or something...

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:18.740
If only Sher had succeeded in the first place, this wouldn't have happened!

00:20:18.740 --> 00:20:21.360
That's right! Sher is the useless one here!

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:22.640
No way...

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:23.510
Um...

00:20:23.510 --> 00:20:24.700
Herc, you stay quiet!

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:31.150
Let's stop this! Calling each other useless here isn't gonna get us anywhere!

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:36.910
We made a promise to become fine detectives and cooperate, didn't we?!

00:20:36.910 --> 00:20:38.090
And yet...!

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:42.300
Sorry, Sher.

00:20:45.880 --> 00:20:48.540
Let's join forces and do our best!

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:51.670
<i>In order to get back to my lovely room!</i>

00:20:51.670 --> 00:20:53.960
<i>In order to eat roast pig!</i>

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:56.230
<i>If everyone says so...</i>

00:20:56.700 --> 00:21:00.860
Let's take back our Toys within three months and then make a comeback as detectives!

00:21:00.860 --> 00:21:02.680
Yeah!

00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:03.780
It went well, eh?

00:21:03.780 --> 00:21:09.450
Torturing them bit by bit and then pushing them to expulsion... Arsène-sama, your ideas are truly―

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:13.960
Beautiful! Wonderful! Sensational and fashionable!

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:14.940
Twenty.

00:21:14.940 --> 00:21:16.250
Stone River.

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:17.380
Ma'am.

00:21:17.820 --> 00:21:18.750
Rat.

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:19.820
Yes!

00:21:20.200 --> 00:21:21.410
Let us head out.

00:21:22.220 --> 00:21:24.470
We have some big fish to fry tonight!

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:26.610
Yahoo!

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:36.600
Octopus balls...

00:23:17.900 --> 00:23:18.810
I'm so hungry...

00:23:18.810 --> 00:23:20.880
Milky Holmes is finally getting a fresh start, eh?

00:23:20.880 --> 00:23:22.000
Let's work hard!

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:23.740
I'd sell my soul for some bread right now!

00:23:23.740 --> 00:23:24.430
Ooh, mushroom!

00:23:24.430 --> 00:23:25.420
I'll have it with butter.

00:23:25.420 --> 00:23:26.400
Or soy sauce?

00:23:26.400 --> 00:23:26.840
Salt!

00:23:26.840 --> 00:23:28.790
Wait, is that mushroom even edible?!

00:23:28.790 --> 00:23:30.380
Yummy~

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:33.280
Eh? We're suspected of being bread thieves?!

00:23:33.280 --> 00:23:34.560
We wouldn't do anything like that!

00:23:34.560 --> 00:23:36.660
No, you'd definitely do it, Sher. Fess up while you still can!

00:23:36.660 --> 00:23:38.250
Stop it! Everyone should get along!

00:23:38.250 --> 00:23:40.740
Well then, who stole the bread?! *Stare*~

00:23:40.740 --> 00:23:42.520
Why are you looking at me?!

00:23:42.520 --> 00:23:44.410
Next Time: A Pocket Full of Bread!

00:23:44.410 --> 00:23:47.530
The culprit is me! Err, why though?
